add('K64SimplifyTool', 'simplifier', `YAGNI pass over the new tool and demo, preserving verified behaviour.
Read ${ROUTE.tool} and ${ROUTE.demo}. Find code or selftest cases that are dead, duplicated, or untestable (e.g. arms that no control or selftest exercises, the unused 'fleet' null branch paths, regex alternatives that can never match). For each candidate prove with a scratch copy that removing it changes no verdict on (a) the selftest, (b) the 16 controls of ${ROUTE.controls} via ${ROUTE.c1probe}'s P2 invocation, (c) the real-data P3 reports (round-60 report at fleet commit 7b0581ed must keep exactly 6 PLACEHOLDER lines and the DISPATCH60_HELD held=10/10 finding; round-63 report at 8fd46e61 must stay CLEAN). Deliver only removals that pass all three, as a unified diff in ${OUT('K64SimplifyTool')}/simplify.diff with the before/after line counts and the three verification outputs. Do not add features.`, ['operability'], 'simplify tool');

